title: "terrasphere_csem"
abstract: >-
  Semi-analytic frequency- and time-domain electromagnetic fields of grounded wires,
  dipoles and loops over a layered earth with a Gaussian hill or depression and an
  optional conductive sphere (quasi-static). Validated against empymod and elfe3D.
